{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Seek</b> — after <b>דרשו</b> there should be <b>דרשו יהוה</b> and <b>דרשו עזו</b>, like: \"and he gave to the captivity עזו\" — and it is the Ark. And the one who explains <b>ועזו</b> like \"in His strength\" is incorrect. And the meaning is like: \"you shall seek His dwelling.\""], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 105, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:38:21.378935377Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}